{title: Emmanuel}
{key: D}

C[D]RISTO, NOMBRE GL[F#m]ORIOSO,

[Em7] [A] – [G] – [F#m] – [Em7]
SALVADOR BELLO, PRECIOSO SEÑOR;
E[D]MMANUEL, DIOS CON NOS[F#m]OTROS,

[Em7] – [A7] [D] – [G] – [D]
PAN DE LA VIDA, CORDERO DE DIOS.

CR[D]ISTO, NOMBRE GLO[F#m]RIOSO,

[Em7] [A] – [G] – [F#m] – [Em7]
ALFA Y OMEGA, ETERNO YO SOY;
C[D]READOR, OMNIPOT[F#m]ENTE,

[Em7] – [A7] [D] – [G] – [D]
REY DE LOS SIGLOS, EL GRAN VENCEDOR.
